Package: descriptiveStats
Title: Simple descriptive statistics for a numeric vector
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jennifer",
    "Williams", 
    email = "jennyemwilliams@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for calculating common descriptive statistics from numeric vectors. It includes functions to calculate the arithmetic mean, median, mode, first quartile (Q1), third quartile (Q3), and interquartile range (IQR).
